RadioTower_Interior3_Text_TeamRocketGrunt25Intro::
	.string "It feels great ordering POKéMON\n"
	.string "to commit crimes.$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_TeamRocketGrunt25Defeat::
	.string "You’re kidding!$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_TeamRocketGrunt25::
	.string "I feel lousy over losing!\p"
	.string "Darn it! I hate useless POKéMON!$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_OldManLyingDown_1::
	.string "It’s the CARD KEY slot.$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_OldManLyingDown_2::
	.string "{PLAYER} inserted the CARD KEY.$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_TeamRocketGrunt13Intro::
	.string "I’ve been given strict orders.\p"
	.string "I’m to crush anyone who challenges\n"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET!$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_TeamRocketGrunt13Defeat::
	.string "What?!$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_TeamRocketGrunt13::
	.string "I failed in my duties...\p"
	.string "I’ll be docked pay for this...$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_Scientist_1::
	.string "To trainers, POKéMON are their\n"
	.string "beloved partners.\p"
	.string "It’s terrible how TEAM ROCKET is\n"
	.string "trying to control POKéMON.$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_Scientist_2::
	.string "We run 24 hours a day to broadcast\n"
	.string "entertaining programs.\p"
	.string "I’ll do my best to run around the\n"
	.string "clock too!$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_ScientistMarcIntro::
	.string "An unknown child wandering here?\n"
	.string "Who are you?$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_ScientistMarcDefeat::
	.string "Tch! I took you too lightly!$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_ScientistMarc::
	.string "Bwahahaha...\p"
	.string "I can transmit as strong a signal as\n"
	.string "I need from here.$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_WorkerM::
	.string "We have recordings of the cries of\n"
	.string "all POKéMON that have been found.\p"
	.string "We must have about 300 kinds.$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_WorkerF_1::
	.string "The TEAM ROCKET boss has locked\n"
	.string "himself in.\p"
	.string "But the DIRECTOR can open it.\p"
	.string "He’s up on the fifth floor.\n"
	.string "Please save him!$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_WorkerF_2::
	.string "You were simply marvelous!$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_WorkerF_3::
	.string "Thank you!\n"
	.string "You’re my hero!\p"
	.string "This is a token of my appreciation.$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_WorkerF_4::
	.string "It’s SUNNY DAY.\n"
	.string "It powers up fire-type moves\l"
	.string "for a while.$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_TeamRocketGrunt39Intro::
	.string "Why did the shutter open? Did you\n"
	.string "have something to do with this?$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_TeamRocketGrunt39Defeat::
	.string "I’m done for!$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_TeamRocketGrunt39::
	.string "What?! You made it past our men in\n"
	.string "the UNDERGROUND?\p"
	.string "How could you?$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_Sign1::
	.string "POKéMON MUSIC with Host DJ BEN$"

RadioTower_Interior3_Text_Sign2::
	.string "3F PERSONNEL$"
